        decision: `Leave it as a quotient of logarithms. Writing $\\log ${WE.R} - \\log ${WE.L}$ here is the slip the reports name, and it changes the answer.`,
        earns: ["M2"],
      },
      {
        n: 4,
        working: `Now evaluate, once: $\\frac{\\log ${WE.R}}{\\log ${WE.L}} = ${d6(L10(WE.R) / L10(WE.L))}$, so $${WE.m}x = ${d6(L10(WE.R) / L10(WE.L) - WE.c)}$ and $x = ${d6(WE.x)}$.`,
        decision: "One calculator step for the whole expression. Rounding the logarithms on the way in moves the second decimal place, which is where the last mark sits.",
        earns: ["M3"],
      },
      {
        n: 5,
        working: `To two decimal places, $x = ${d2(WE.x).toFixed(2)}$.`,
        decision: `Check it: $${WE.L}^{${WE.m}(${d2(WE.x).toFixed(2)}) ${WE.c < 0 ? "-" : "+"} ${Math.abs(WE.c)}} = ${d2(WE.L ** (WE.m * d2(WE.x) + WE.c)).toFixed(2)}$, which is the right-hand side to the accuracy carried.`,
        earns: ["W1"],
      },
    ],
    finalAnswer: `$x = ${d2(WE.x).toFixed(2)}$`,
    twin: {
